      "cooked": "<p>You know, it doesn’t really matter how well you’re doing; if Scum and Villainy brings out an Electro-Pulse Explosive when you’re fighting Omnitron, you’re going to have a bad day.</p>\n<p>One-turn party wipe from double-digit health on all heroes.  Ugh.</p>",
