      "created_at": "2014-04-17T22:04:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Cool, a mass-environment-powered Scorched Earth sounds like a great use of the MDP environment...as long as you don't accidentally end up nuking the Propulsion Systems. I suppose you could make sure that if they're in play, that they've been removed by other means (Blinding Speed or whatever) before you start nuking All of the Things :D.</p>",
